<title>FINLAND: SUPREME COURT IGNORES KESKO APPEAL.</title>
<headline>SUPREME COURT IGNORES KESKO APPEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish Supreme Administrative Court decided not to investigate wholesaler Kesko Oy's appeal about the board of competition's decision the ask the EU to probe its merger with Tuko, Kesko said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;(The court) ruled on October 1 1996 that with regard to the requirements for examining appeals, the issue's nature and particularly the short deadlines set by the merger supervision decree, there were no prerequisites to examine the appeal,&quot; Kesko said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
